    {
      "type": "aesthetically-pleasing",
      "title": "Noted",
      "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0;    ; font-family: IBM Plex Sans, sans-serif !important; font-size: 19px !important; line-height: 1.4 !important; color: #111111 !important; text-align: left !important\">Olalekan B. Jeyifous is an extraordinary creative whose practice crosses across and between architecture, public art, immersive installation, and speculative visual culture—making. What I enjoy in particular with is work is the way he is able to integrate generative imaging techniques, tools, and practices that are meaning-making first, and technique second. This is most certainly not “AI Slop”.</p>",
